{
  "uid": "bullmq",
  "title": "BullMQ Queues",
  "description": "Queue health from the API's gauges in apps/api/src/common/queue/queue.metrics.ts: queue_jobs_waiting, queue_jobs_active, queue_jobs_failed, queue_jobs_delayed. The API publishes these itself, so no separate BullMQ Prometheus exporter is needed. Note: there is no cumulative completed counter; only the four point-in-time gauges are emitted.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "tags": ["bullmq", "queues"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Status",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## BullMQ Queue Gauges\n\nThe API's `MetricsModule` exposes per-queue gauges (see `apps/api/src/common/queue/queue.metrics.ts`):\n\n- `queue_jobs_waiting{queue=\"...\"}`: jobs waiting to be processed\n- `queue_jobs_active{queue=\"...\"}`: jobs currently being processed\n- `queue_jobs_failed{queue=\"...\"}`: jobs currently in the failed set\n- `queue_jobs_delayed{queue=\"...\"}`: jobs scheduled for later\n\nThese are point-in-time gauges, not cumulative counters, so there is no completed-per-second series. Scrape config: `observability/prometheus/prometheus.yml`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Waiting Jobs",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "queue_jobs_waiting",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed Jobs by Queue",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "queue_jobs_failed",
          "legendFormat": "failed {{queue}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total Failed Jobs",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(queue_jobs_failed)",
          "legendFormat": "failed jobs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Jobs",
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 12, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(queue_jobs_active)",
          "legendFormat": "active jobs"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
